### Audiophile API — click "Send request" above each block (Visual Studio or VS Code REST Client).
### Start with 1 (register) or 2 (login): the requests after them use the token they return.
@base = http://localhost:5040
# XX59 Headphones (4,499 EGP), seeded by the first migration.
@productId = 4ae5911a-421b-4565-b75f-53809c3da182
# Send 2 (login) first: the other requests use its token, {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}.
# (Not a top-level @token variable: Visual Studio evaluates those before every request, and one
# that points at a response fails with HTTP0012 until that response exists.)


############################## Auth

### 1. Register a customer (201). Change the email to register another one.
# @name register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mona Hassan", "email": "mona@example.com", "password": "password-123" }

### 2. Log in. For the admin, use Admin:Email / Admin:Password from `dotnet user-secrets list`.
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mona@example.com", "password": "password-123" }

### 3. Who am I?
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4. New token pair. Send it twice: the second use of the same refresh token is
#    treated as theft and ends every session (log in again with 2 afterwards).
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}" }

### 5. Log out this session
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}" }


############################## Catalogue

### 6. Browse: every filter is optional
GET {{base}}/products?category=Headphones&minPrice=1000&page=1&pageSize=12

### 7. One product
GET {{base}}/products/{{productId}}

### 8. Add a product (admin only: log in as the admin in 2 first, otherwise 403)
POST {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "XX99 Mark I Headphones",
  "description": "As the gold standard for headphones, the classic XX99 Mark I offers detailed and accurate audio reproduction.",
  "features": "Lightweight build, detachable cable.",
  "price": 9999,
  "stock": 12,
  "category": "Headphones",
  "imageUrl": null,
  "inTheBox": { "Headphone unit": 1, "Replacement earcups": 2, "User manual": 1 }
}


############################## Addresses

### 9. Save an address
# @name address
POST {{base}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullAddressName": "Mona Hassan", "street": "12 Tahrir Street", "city": "Cairo", "country": "Egypt", "phone": "+201000000000", "postalCode": null }

### 10. My addresses
GET {{base}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


############################## Cart

### 11. Add to cart
POST {{base}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 }

### 12. My cart
GET {{base}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


############################## Orders
# Orders are placed from the cart (add something in 11 first) and a saved address (9).
# The full card-payment journey with Fawaterak is in checkout-flow.http.

### 13. Cash on delivery — confirmed immediately. A new Idempotency-Key on every send.
# @name codOrder
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: cod-{{$timestamp}}

{ "addressId": "{{address.response.body.$.id}}", "paymentMethod": "CashOnDelivery" }

### 14. Resend with the SAME Idempotency-Key as 13 → 200, the same order, nothing new
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{codOrder.request.headers.Idempotency-Key}}

{ "addressId": "{{address.response.body.$.id}}", "paymentMethod": "CashOnDelivery" }

### 15. My orders
GET {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 16. Health
GET {{base}}/health
